# A detached `npm start` writes its output here.
.start.*
# Regenerated wholesale by the OpenSpec CLI on every upgrade, so they are not
# tracked. The one exception is .github/workflows/copilot-setup-steps.yml,
# which Copilot's coding agent needs in the repository; it stays tracked and
# the ignore below does not apply to it.
.claude*
.github*
